.Dd May 17, 2026
.Dt MACOSWHEELS-AUTOCENTER 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm macoswheels-autocenter
.Nd set autocenter spring strength of a racing wheel
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm macoswheels
.Cm autocenter
.Ar percent
.Op Ar wheel
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Sets the autocenter spring strength of the selected wheel.
Value is a percentage from 0 (no centering force) to 100
(maximum centering force the wheel hardware supports).
.Pp
This setting is independent of any in-game spring effect.
Games that drive their own spring through the PID interface
override this temporarily; the value is restored when the
game releases the effect.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr macoswheels 1
